  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 306.09 Administrative Support Services. The local school board shall ensure that all school records shall be maintained in accordance with local policy, state laws and rules, and federal laws and regulations.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at part heading for Ed 306) #14150, eff 12-13-24",
